<title>USA: Hertz names Paul Siracusa CFO.</title>
<headline>Hertz names Paul Siracusa CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PARK RIDGE, N.J. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hertz Corp said Tuesday it named Paul Siracusa chief financial officer and executive vice president effective August 1.</p>
<p>He will replace William Sider, who will retire from the company in 1998. A spokeswoman said Sider will remain with the company during a transition period once Siracusa's appointment as CFO becomes effective August 1.</p>
<p>Siracusa is currently vice president of finance and chief financial officer of Hertz International Ltd. He has been with Hertz since 1969.</p>
